ales activities & coordinate with customer\\\\/client for better customer satisfaction & sale. Handled Marketing Strategy \\\\/ Market intelligence \\\\/ Public relation \\\\/ Planning Strategies for business development & sales following up all marketing activities etc.Preparation of Invoices\\\\/Quotation Delivery Order & Sending\\\\/Receiving E-mail & C0-ordinate with various Shipping\\\\/ Logistics Companies. Monitor the courier services. Arrange international shipment pick up & follow up until reach the destination. Responsible for direct shipment from overseas vendor\\\\u2019s quotation, purchasing procedures. Payment terms & conditions\\",\\"last_updated\\":\\"2025-04-17T08:56:27.498436\\",\\"sub_department\\":\\"\\",\\"is_current\\":false},{\\"start_date\\":\\"2002-09-01\\",\\"end_date\\":\\"2005-02-01\\",\\"company\\":\\"PIL- Pacific International Line (Singapore based)\\",\\"company_name\\":\\"PIL- Pacific International Line (Singapore based)\\",\\"company_id\\":null,\\"company_linkedin_url\\":null,\\"department\\":\\"Marketing\\",\\"title\\":\\"Marketing Officer\\",\\"highest_level\\":\\"senior\\",\\"description\\":\\"Visited customer regularly on daily basis for securing Export\\\\/Import Sea & Air Shipment biz & Correspondence work with local as well as international Customer \\\\/ Client & International Agent for offer the quotation \\\\/ Planning strategies for biz development & sales & follow up all marketing activities etc,My responsibilities are to do the correspondence with Agents\\\\/Clients & all other documentation work with customers, dealing & to entertain their queries.\\",\\"last_updated\\":\\"2025-04-17T08:56:27.498436\\",\\"sub_department\\":\\"Product_marketing\\",\\"is_current\\":false},{\\"start_date\\":\\"1985-09-01\\",\\"end_date\\":\\"2001-12-01\\",\\"company\\":\\"Merchant Navy\\",\\"company_name\\":\\"Merchant Navy\\",\\"company_id\\":3142985,\\"company_linkedin_url\\":\\"https:\\\\/\\\\/www.linkedin.com\\\\/company\\\\/merchant-n