ided strategic recommendations to the President and Vice President, enhancing their understanding of vessel operations and addressing potential challenges.\\",\\"last_updated\\":\\"2025-04-29T07:44:15.405472\\",\\"sub_department\\":\\"Systems\\",\\"is_current\\":true},{\\"start_date\\":\\"2024-09-01\\",\\"end_date\\":\\"Present\\",\\"company\\":\\"Taipei University of Marine Technology\\",\\"company_name\\":\\"Taipei University of Marine Technology\\",\\"company_id\\":null,\\"company_linkedin_url\\":null,\\"department\\":\\"Education\\",\\"title\\":\\"Lecturer\\",\\"highest_level\\":\\"individual contributor\\",\\"description\\":\\"Presently appointed as a part-time lecturer in the Department of Marine Engineering, responsible for instructing naval officers in continuing education programs and delivering STCW 2010 certification courses.\\",\\"last_updated\\":\\"2025-04-29T07:44:15.405472\\",\\"sub_department\\":\\"Professor\\",\\"is_current\\":false},{\\"start_date\\":\\"2023-05-01\\",\\"end_date\\":\\"2024-04-01\\",\\"company\\":\\"Unison Marine Group\\",\\"company_name\\":\\"Unison Marine Group\\",\\"company_id\\":null,\\"company_linkedin_url\\":null,\\"department\\":\\"\\",\\"title\\":\\"Technical Superintendent and Port Chief Engineer\\",\\"highest_level\\":\\"individual contributor\\",\\"description\\":\\"1. Oversaw vessel certification management, spare parts auditing, and inventory control to ensure operational efficiency. 2. Led ship dry-docking project and fault analyses. 3. Assisted colleagues in understanding vessel conditions and provided technical guidance. 4. Temporarily served as Chief Engineer onboard bulk carriers to assess onboard performance and gain hands-on insights.\\",\\"last_updated\\":\\"2025-04-29T07:44:15.405472\\",\\"sub_department\\":\\"\\",\\"is_current\\":false},{\\"start_date\\":\\"2012-08-01\\",\\"end_date\\":\\"2023-04-01\\",\\"company\\":\\"Wisdom Marine Group\\",\\"company_name\\":\\"Wisdom Marine Group\\",\\"company_id\\":null,\\"company_linkedin_url\\":null,\\"department\\":\\"Engineering\\",\\"title\\":\\"Technical Superintendent\\",\\"highest_level\\":\\"senior\\",\\"description\\":\\"1. Progressed through roles as Engineer, Deputy Manager, and Technical Manager, demonstrating consistent career growth and increasing responsibility. 2. Managed a diverse fleet, including general cargo vessels, multipurpose vessels, RORO vessels, timber vessels, bulk carriers, and high-speed aluminum catamarans. 3. Spearheaded vessel certification management, spare parts auditing, and inventory control to ensure operational efficiency. 4. Planned and supervised ship inspections, dry-docking, and voyage repairs, effectively managed budgets to reduce operational costs. 5. Supervised international technical repairs and coordinated inspections with Flag and Right Ship surveyors, ensuring compliance and operational excellence, including a six-month assignment managing vessel repairs in China during the COVID-19 pandemic. 6. Performed regular ship visits to assess real-time operational conditions and address technical challenges. 7. Supervised PMS implementation to ensure timely and effective equipment maintenance. 8. Provided fault resolution strategies and technical guidance for managed vessels to enhance reliability. 9. Compiled detailed fleet reports for documentation and record-keeping to support regulatory compliance. 10. Temporarily served as Chief Engineer onboard high-speed crafts and bulk carriers to assess onboard performance and gain hands-on insights. 11. Gained experience in new ship deliveries by overseeing transfer processes and certifications at foreign shipyards to ensure seamless fleet integration, as well as supervising on-site deliveries for the sale of operational vessel.\\",\\"last_updated\\":\\"2025-04-29T07:44:15.405472\\",\\"sub_department\\":\\"Systems\\",\\"is_current\\":false}]"', '"[{\\"major\\":\\"Naval Architecture and Marine Engineering\\",\\"school\\":\\"National Taiwan Ocean University\\",\\"degree\\":\\"Master\'s degree\\",\\"start\\":2020,\\"end\\":2022},{\\"major\\":\\"Naval Architecture and Marine Engineering\\",\\"school\\":\\"Taipei University of Marine Technology\\",\\"degree\\":\\"Bachelor\'s degree\\",\\"start\\":2005,\\"end\\":2009}]"', '"[]"', '"[]"', '"{\\"profile_list\\":{\\"id\\":29016828,\\"name\\":\\"API Contacts\\"},\\"id\\":842071780,\\"links\\":{\\"linkedin\\":\\"https:\\\\/\\\\/www.linkedin.com\\\\/in\\\\/ching-hui-yang-565558266\\"},\\"region_latitude\\":null,\\"region_longitude\\":null,\\"npi_data\\":null,\\"tags\\":[{\\"id\\":25493700,\\"name\\":\\"API Contacts\\"}],\\"current_work_email\\":null,\\"current_personal_email\\":null}"', null, null, null, '2025-08-25 17:54:41', '2025-08-25 17:54:41', null);
