L to CGK : Commodity : Carbon ( DG cargo) c) 2017 till present : Sea & Airfreight : Sweden to PKG & China to KUL : Oil & Gas : OPW projects d) 2018 - Airfreight : KUL to MEX : Transformer : 300 tonnes : ABB Malaysia SB e) 2017- present : Conventional , Flat rack , Airfreight , Reefer Container * Familiar with custom procedure Import /Export : Airfreight /Sea freight /Transportation /Project Shipment / DG cargo class 2,3,4,6,& 9 and etc * Familiar with Shipping teams, HS tariff code * Supervise and guide team to arranged shipment Ex-work /DDP/DDU/FOB/CIF * Supervise and handling project shipment such as Flat rack, Conventional, Lo-Loader ,ISO Tank ,Oil & Gas Shipment , etc. *Coordinating and preparing sales documentation and order processing. Perform any other duties assigned by superior from time to time. * Direct dealing & communicate with oversea agent base on inquiries. Liaise with Oversea Agent regarding quotation, shipment arrangement , payment terms and condition . * Coordinate with carrier on incoming and outgoing shipment arrangement * Advice,monitor,follow up and update on NOA, BL and etc", "company_name": "AVIS PIONEER LOGISTICS SB", "last_updated": "2025-04-03T08:09:58.254196", "highest_level": "individual contributor", "sub_department": "", "company_linkedin_url": null}]', '[{"end": 2004, "major": "Business Administration and Management, General", "start": 1999, "degree": "Bachelor of Business Administration - BBA", "school": "Kolej Yayasan Melaka Cum University Utara Malaysia"}]', '[]', '[]', '{"id": 311897426, "tags": [{"id": 25493700, "name": "API Contacts"}], "links": {"linkedin": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/kalay-arasi-56471b188"}, "npi_data": null, "profile_list": {"id": 29016828, "name": "API Contacts"}, "region_latitude": 3.044917, "region_longitude": 101.4455621, "current_work_email": null, "current_personal_email": null}', null, null, null, '2025-08-31 11:54:10', '2025-08-31 11:54:10', null);
