ment amendments, and compliance to operating procedures and other related matters. -Handles bookings (Encoding of data on Cargowise (EDI) ) and checking its accuracy as per documents attached – Consol and Brokerage Registration -Monitors the transshipment status of all the shipments through websites and direct contact with the shipping lines. -Directly chases the Tax Invoices and EDOs with the shipping lines and agents for cargo release. -Pays necessary charges through Bank-to-back Compay Payment scheme -Efficiently navigates through one-stop website in able to obtain up-to-date information about vessel movement, voyage numbers and destination. -Lodge the Sea Cargo reports in the Integrated Customs System (ICS). Manages the distribution of tasks among the members of the team. -Directly coordinates with the Australian operators about the task flow, SOP, and Manila team compliance. -Books the pick-up of shipments with the transport company. -Compiling and Identification of Classification of various commodities in order to determine the applicable and HS Code and its corresponding Rate of Duty -Ensures accuracy and timeliness computation of freight as per invoice given for proper liquidation on the system -Accomplishes accurate declaration and lodgment of entries to Australian Customs -Invoicing job and posting of charges billed by the shipping line, export agent and transport company", "company_name": "Pioneer International Logistics", "last_updated": "2024-10-10T07:56:44.270111", "highest_level": "individual contributor", "sub_department": "", "company_linkedin_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/company/pioneer-international-logistics"}]', '[{"end": 2013, "major": "Customs Administration and Trade and Tariff Laws", "start": 2009, "degree": "Bachelor of Science (B.S.)", "school": "Lyceum of the Philippines  - Batangas City"}]', '["Freight", "Customs Regulations", "Shipping"]', '{"error": "Insufficient balance for company lookup"}', '{"id": 138879005, "tags": [{"id": 2549