transportation profits and laytime, preparing required documents.", "company_name": "GULF BULK CARRIERS", "last_updated": "2024-09-25T17:24:33.241437", "highest_level": "individual contributor", "sub_department": "Accounts", "company_linkedin_url": null}, {"title": "Ship Broker", "company": "PAX ATLANTIC CORP.", "end_date": "2013-01-01", "company_id": null, "department": "Finance", "is_current": false, "start_date": "2010-01-01", "description": "Chartering / Operation Dept. Company working on brokerage of vessels to transport bulk commodities such as coal, clinker, iron ore, nickel ore, agricultural products for long distances. Total quantity of carriage raises up to 2,000,000 mts per year. Worked in chartering department and was responsible of Suez/Japan range. • Achieved to fix 20-90.0000 metric tons deadweight ships to carry various commodities . • Opened a new window to the company with Supramax and Panamax businesses. • Fixed total about 500,000 metric tons of bulk cargo in a very competitive market. • Created effective business relations with new traders and ship owners in varied countries (especially in Germany) by marketing activities and visiting their offices (in Hamburg and Düsseldorf). • Followed operations, liaised with responsible sides of shipments, calculated transportation profits and laytime, prepared required documents.", "company_name": "PAX ATLANTIC CORP.", "last_updated": "2024-09-25T17:24:33.241437", "highest_level": "individual contributor", "sub_department": "", "company_linkedin_url": null}, {"title": "Ship Broker", "company": "AKSOY DENIZCILIK", "end_date": "2009-01-01", "company_id": null, "department": "Finance", "is_current": false, "start_date": "2007-01-01", "description": "Chartering/Operation Dept. Company working on brokerage of Handy and Panamax vessels to transport bulk coal cargo from China and W.Africa to Turkey. Total quantity of carriage raises up to 2,000,000 mts per year. • Worked on ship brokering and conducted operations of shipments. Was responsible to fix abt.30,000mts bulk coal cargo from Maputo/Durban to Turkey. • Fixed total about 350,000 metric tons of bulk coal cargo in a very competitive market. • Followed operations, liaised with responsible sides of shipments, calculated transportation profits and laytime, prepared required documents.", "company_name": "AKSOY DENIZCILIK", "last_updated": "2024-09-25T17:24:33.241437", "highest_level": "individual contributor", "sub_department": "", "company_linkedin_url": null}, {"title": "Ship Broker", "company": "Unicor Uluslararası Dış.Tic. ve Nak.Şti", "end_date": "2007-01-01", "company_id": null, "department": "Finance", "is_current": false, "start_date": "2006-01-01", "description": "– Chartering/Operation Dept. Company working on chartering of own vessels to transport bulk commodities such as coal, clinker . Total quantity of carriage raises up to 500,000 mts per year.", "company_name": "Unicor Uluslararası Dış.Tic. ve Nak.Şti", "last_updated": "2024-09-25T17:24:33.241437", "highest_level": "individual contributor", "sub_department": "", "company_linkedin_url": null}, {"title": "Ship Broker", "company": "PAX ATLANTIC CORP.", "end_date": "2006-01-01", "company_id": null, "department": "Finance", "is_current": false, "start_date": "2004-01-01", "description": "– Chartering/Operation Dept. Company working on brokerage of vessels to transport bulk commodities such as coal, clinker, agricultural products for long distances. Total quantity of carriage raises up to 1,000,000 mts per year. • First six months learnt ship brokering basics and conducted operations of shipments. After this period, qualified to Chartering Department of Worldwide . • Achieved to fix 5-30.0000 metric tons deadweight ships to carry various commodities . • Created effective business relations with new traders and ship owners in Turkey by marketing activities and visiting their offices. • Followed operations, liaised with responsible sides of shipments, calculated transportation profits and laytime, prepared required documents.", "company_name": "PAX ATLANTIC CORP.", "last_updated": "2024-09-25T17:24:33.241437", "highest_level": "individual contributor", "sub_department": "", "company_linkedin_url": null}]', '[{"end": 2004, "major": null, "start": 2000, "degree": null, "school": "Marmara Üniversitesi"}]', '["- 2007 - Rina Kozyatağı - ISM Code Cert. - 2007 - 100 Hours- Rönesans Akademi –", "Financial Reporting", "Sellers", "Ism Code Cert", "Investment Properties", "Buyer Representation"]', '[]', '{"id": 31027875, "tags": [{"id": 25493700, "name": "API Contacts"}], "links": {"linkedin": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/hulya-zenger-8ba1b1108"}, "npi_data": null, "profile_list": {"id": 29016828, "name": "API Contacts"}, "region_latitude": 40.9975, "region_longitude": 28.850556, "current_work_email": null, "current_personal_email": null}', null, null, null, '2025-09-14 18:37:25', '2025-09-14 18:37:25', null);
