rs and vessel owners. *Settling Laytime disputes with proper understanding and implementation of charter party clauses *Finalizing Vessel stowage plan after discussing with master and ensuring maximum quantity of cargo is loaded keeping in consideration dwt calculations of vessel. *Negotiating Ports DAs with agents, *Preparing hire statements, monitoring vessel performance and preparing speed claims if any. *Ensuring files are settled in a timely manner with head charterers/ head owners and in case if required to deal with P&I club and lawyers for claim settlements. *Involved in Switching bill of lading , preparing shipping documents,invoices, packing list, certificate of origin for company imports business for their imports shipments *Procuring Bunkers for company dry bulk vessels LSMGO ,VLSFO, HSFO and other alternative biodiesel fuels  for period and voyage charters as per the requirement. *Well Sound knowledge of  New IMO regulations of CII Emissions and EU ETS allowances calculations for vessels calling european ports and resolving issues with head owners as per BIMCO clauses.", "company_name": "Anchor shipping Ltd  Dry Bulk Operator", "last_updated": "2025-06-14T03:47:15.378786", "highest_level": "individual contributor", "sub_department": "", "company_linkedin_url": null}, {"title": "Operations and Laytime Manager and Bunker Procurer", "company": "Kopak Shipping Company ( Managers for Pacific Gulf Shipping Company )", "end_date": "2019-10-01", "company_id": null, "department": "", "is_current": false, "start_date": "2012-07-01", "description": "Worked  in Kopak Shipping Company as Laytime & Operations Manager and Bunker Procurer Dry Bulk Shipping. Having valuable experience of about 8 years. My job description at Kopak Shipping was  related to Accounting , Post fixtures operations,Laytime Analyst bunkering procurement. Heading team of 5 members. Exclusively dealing for Pacific Gulf Shipping Company fleets on period and time charter for their Singapore and Dubai Office. Involved in all posts fixtures operations for dry cargo                                                                     negotiating and finalizing PDA,  Preparing Laytime calculations , hire statements, dealing with P&I club for settlement of legal disputes related to Chartering And operations                                                                                            Dealing And negotiating LC opening for trade  import Heading management of accounts receivables for company and claim handler for all shipping disputes. Major area was settling laytime disputes. Procured  Bunkers for company\'s  fleet and looking after bunkering operations. Responsible for preparing reports for company\' s Analysis on vessels performance both financial and Analytical positions and then assisting in future workability .", "company_name": "Kopak Shipping Company ( Managers for Pacific Gulf Shipping Company )", "last_updated": "2025-06-14T03:47:15.378786", "highest_level": "individual contributor", "sub_department": "", "company_linkedin_url": null}]', '[{"end": 2011, "major": "Finance, General", "start": 2010, "degree": "Master of Business Administration (MBA)", "school": "University of Karachi"}, {"end": 2008, "major": "Commerce", "start": 2007, "degree": "Bachelor\'s degree", "school": "D-A Degree College, Karachi"}, {"end": 2006, "major": "Pre-Engineering", "start": 2004, "degree": "Higher Secondary School", "school": "ST PATRICK\'S COLLEGE, KARACHI"}, {"end": 2004, "major": "Science", "start": 2002, "degree": "Secondary School Certificate", "school": "JENNINGS SECONDARY SCHOOL"}, {"end": null, "major": null, "start": null, "degree": "in progress", "school": "Institute of Chartered Shipbrokers"}, {"end": null, "major": "Accounting and Finance", "start": null, "degree": "Master of Business Administration - MBA", "school": "Karachi University"}]', '["Accounting", "Works well in a team", "Security Analysis", "Microsoft Office", "Corporate Finance", "Microsoft Excel", "Fast Learner", "Financial Analysis", "Analysis", "Teamwork", "PowerPoint", "Cash", "Interpersonal Communication Abilities", "Microsoft Word", "Operations Management", "shipping management", "bunker procurer", "banking operations", "letter of credit", "bill of lading", "laytime calculations"]', '[]', '{"id": 93506256, "tags": [{"id": 25493700, "name": "API Contacts"}], "links": {"linkedin": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/mohammed-amir-uddin-78772345"}, "npi_data": null, "profile_list": {"id": 29016828, "name": "API Contacts"}, "region_latitude": 24.996112, "region_longitude": 67.154845, "current_work_email": null, "current_personal_email": "aamir_uddin8@yahoo.com"}', null, null, null, '2025-09-14 18:37:56', '2025-09-14 18:37:56', null);
